OL,3,GNEWSAReview finds 'no relevant
OL,4,Ainformation' about Donaldson when
OL,5,AStormont junior minister
OL,6,
OL,7,FA review into sex offender Jeffrey
OL,8,FDonaldson's conduct during his time as
OL,9,Fa Stormont junior minister has
OL,10,Fconcluded with "no relevant
OL,11,Finformation" found.
OL,13,FThe "scoping exercise" was launched by
OL,14,Fthe Northern Ireland Civil Service
OL,15,F(NICS) last month with staff asked to
OL,16,Fcome forward if they "experienced abuse
OL,17,For inappropriate behaviour".
