OL,3,GNEWSAReview finds 'no relevant
OL,4,Ainformation' about Donaldson when
OL,5,AStormont junior minister
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonaldson, a former leader of the
OL,8,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP), was
OL,9,Fconvicted in June of 18 counts of sex
OL,10,Fabuse including one of rape, which he
OL,11,Fcommitted against two women when they
OL,12,Fwere children. He is seeking to appeal.
OL,14,FThe former MP was a junior minister at
OL,15,Fthe Office of the First and Deputy
OL,16,FFirst Minister from February 2008 until
OL,17,FJuly 2009.
